  "description": "The Velec R48+ is designed for comfortable long journeys. A powerful, high-torque 500-watt rear-wheel motor will tackle headwinds and steep inclines, and the 48-volt, 14-amp battery gives you the pedal assist you need to explore much longer rides.\nNow equipped with two sensors (torque and cadence) the R48+ can be used in torque or cadence mode, depending on the owner's preference.\nIt's equipped with a throttle to help you navigate if you don't want to pedal or need a little extra help climbing hills. The suspension fork and spring saddle will ensure you ride like you're on a cloud. With a 14Ah battery, you can get a range of up to 120 km with pedal pedal assist. The battery integrated into the frame balances the weight for agile riding and more stability.\nNew: Turn signals are added to the rear of the bike. The R48+ also comes with aluminum mudguards, a horn, a more robust chain guard, and a rear rack with an integrated light. The hub bearings are sealed.\nOptimal For Riders: 5'3\" / 1m60 to 5'6\" / 1m67 (Small) ; 5'7\" / 1m70 to 5'10\" / 1m77 (Medium) ; 5'11\" / 1m80 to 6'3\" / 1m90 (Large)",
